# Job Hunt Locator — environment configuration
#
# Good news: this app needs NO API key, NO signup, and NO subscription.
# Live jobs are pulled from Remotive (https://remotive.com/api/remote-jobs),
# a free, public, keyless job board API. There is nothing to configure —
# you can delete this file, or just leave it as-is. `npm run dev` works
# immediately after `npm install`.
#
# If the live feed is ever unreachable, rate-limited, or returns nothing
# usable, the app automatically switches to Demo Mode: a curated, offline
# dataset of real Ahmedabad startups (Quicko, Saleshandy, Crest Data
# Systems, Matter Motor, and more) — no crashes, no blank screens, no keys
# required there either.
